  "system": {
    "identifier": "ripping-lunge",
    "description": "<p>You lunge forward while striking your opponent to maximize the impact power of your shot. Select a creature and move up to 20-feet closer to them, and make a ranged taijutsu attack against them. On a hit you deal your [Weapons damage] + 2d10 and force them to make a Constitution saving throw, being knocked Bruised on a failed save.</p>\n<p>Chain 1: A creature who failed their saving throw is also pushed 10 feet into a direction of your choice, except upwards.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: On a successful hit, another allied creature can spend their reaction to cast a Taijutsu with the Finisher keyword that has a casting time of 1 Action, targeting the same creature.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d10.</p>",
